<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#071316">
  <meta
    name="description"
    content="AXIOM — Build AI. Own AI. An open AI engineering platform for models, datasets, training, evaluation and deployment."
  >
  <title>AXIOM — Build AI. Own AI.</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="./styles.css">
</head>

<body>
  <div class="noise"></div>

  <header class="nav">
    <a class="brand" href="#">
      <span class="brand-mark">A</span>
      <span>
        <strong>AXIOM</strong>
        <small>AI ENGINEERING PLATFORM</small>
      </span>
    </a>

    <nav class="nav-links">
      <a href="#platform">Platform</a>
      <a href="#architecture">Architecture</a>
      <a href="#workflow">Workflow</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/NetCore-Technologies/AXIOM-AI" target="_blank">GitHub ↗</a>
    </nav>

    <a
      class="nav-button"
      href="https://github.com/NetCore-Technologies/AXIOM-AI"
      target="_blank"
    >
      Control Center
    </a>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-grid"></div>

      <div class="hero-copy reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow">
          <span class="pulse"></span>
          NETCORE TECHNOLOGIES
          <span class="dot">•</span>
          OPEN AI ENGINEERING
        </div>

        <h1>
          Build AI.
          <span>Own AI.</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="hero-text">
          AXIOM is an AI engineering platform designed to bring
          models, datasets, training, evaluation, optimization,
          runtime tooling and system intelligence into one controlled
          environment.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a
            class="button primary"
            href="https://github.com/NetCore-Technologies/AXIOM-AI"
            target="_blank"
          >
            Explore AXIOM
            <span>↗</span>
          </a>

          <a class="button secondary" href="#platform">
            Explore Platform
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-meta">
          <div>
            <strong>0.2.0</strong>
            <span>Current development line</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>Python + React</strong>
            <span>Engine + Control Center</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>Open Source</strong>
            <span>Built by NetCore Technologies</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-console reveal">
        <div class="console-shell">
          <div class="console-top">
            <div class="window-dots">
              <i></i><i></i><i></i>
            </div>
            <span>AXIOM / CONTROL CENTER</span>
            <span class="online">● ONLINE</span>
          </div>

          <div class="console-body">
            <div class="status-card">
              <span class="label">SYSTEM STATUS</span>
              <strong>HEALTHY</strong>
              <small>All core services operational</small>
            </div>

            <div class="metric-row">
              <div class="metric">
                <span>MODELS</span>
                <strong>READY</strong>
              </div>
              <div class="metric">
                <span>DATASETS</span>
                <strong>READY</strong>
              </div>
              <div class="metric">
                <span>TRAINING</span>
                <strong>PLANNER</strong>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="graph">
              <div class="graph-header">
                <span>REQUEST TELEMETRY</span>
                <span>LIVE</span>
              </div>

              <svg viewBox="0 0 600 170" preserveAspectRatio="none">
                <defs>
                  <linearGradient id="area" x1="0" x2="0" y1="0" y2="1">
                    <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#23e6d2" stop-opacity=".34"/>
                    <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#23e6d2" stop-opacity="0"/>
                  </linearGradient>
                </defs>

                <path
                  class="graph-area"
                  d="M0 140 L35 122 L70 130 L105 95 L140 110 L175 78 L210 96 L245 60 L280 76 L315 49 L350 70 L385 43 L420 58 L455 31 L490 52 L525 28 L560 44 L600 18 L600 170 L0 170 Z"
                />

                <path
                  class="graph-line"
                  d="M0 140 L35 122 L70 130 L105 95 L140 110 L175 78 L210 96 L245 60 L280 76 L315 49 L350 70 L385 43 L420 58 L455 31 L490 52 L525 28 L560 44 L600 18"
                />
              </svg>
            </div>

            <div class="terminal">
              <p><span>$</span> axiom system info</p>
              <p class="ok">✓ Hardware detection complete</p>
              <p class="ok">✓ Model registry online</p>
              <p class="ok">✓ Dataset pipeline online</p>
              <p class="muted">AXIOM ready.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="platform" class="section">
      <div class="section-heading reveal">
        <div>
          <span class="section-index">01 / PLATFORM</span>
          <h2>One control plane for the AI lifecycle.</h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          AXIOM is designed around the engineering work that happens
          before, during and after model development.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-grid">
        <article class="feature reveal">
          <span class="feature-number">01</span>
          <h3>Models</h3>
          <p>
            Inspect, register, analyze and manage model assets while
            understanding architecture, weight size, formats and
            hardware requirements.
          </p>
          <span class="feature-tag">MODEL REGISTRY</span>
        </article>

        <article class="feature reveal">
          <span class="feature-number">02</span>
          <h3>Datasets</h3>
          <p>
            Inspect datasets for validity, duplicates, empty samples,
            estimated tokens and schema consistency before training.
          </p>
          <span class="feature-tag">DATA PIPELINE</span>
        </article>

        <article class="feature reveal">
          <span class="feature-number">03</span>
          <h3>Training</h3>
          <p>
            Generate hardware-aware training plans with precision,
            batch, gradient accumulation, sequence length and
            parameter-efficient strategies.
          </p>
          <span class="feature-tag">TRAINING ENGINE</span>
        </article>

        <article class="feature reveal">
          <span class="feature-number">04</span>
          <h3>Evaluation</h3>
          <p>
            Give evaluation its own engineering surface so model
            quality can be measured independently from training.
          </p>
          <span class="feature-tag">QUALITY</span>
        </article>

        <article class="feature reveal">
          <span class="feature-number">05</span>
          <h3>Runtime</h3>
          <p>
            A dedicated runtime layer provides the foundation for
            serving, execution, observability and future deployment.
          </p>
          <span class="feature-tag">RUNTIME</span>
        </article>

        <article class="feature reveal">
          <span class="feature-number">06</span>
          <h3>MCP</h3>
          <p>
            Expose AXIOM capabilities through MCP tooling for
            inspection, automation and integration with external
            engineering workflows.
          </p>
          <span class="feature-tag">MCP READY</span>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="architecture" class="architecture-section">
      <div class="section-heading reveal">
        <div>
          <span class="section-index">02 / ARCHITECTURE</span>
          <h2>Engineered as a platform, not a wrapper.</h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          The Control Center sits above the AXIOM Python engine,
          exposing one interface to the underlying AI workflow.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="architecture reveal">
        <div class="arch-node top">
          <span>AXIOM CONTROL CENTER</span>
          <small>React / Vite</small>
        </div>

        <div class="connector vertical"></div>

        <div class="arch-node api">
          <span>CONTROL API</span>
          <small>Application Boundary</small>
        </div>

        <div class="connector vertical"></div>

        <div class="arch-row">
          <div class="arch-node">
            <span>MODELS</span>
            <small>Registry + Analysis</small>
          </div>

          <div class="arch-node">
            <span>DATASETS</span>
            <small>Inspection + Cleaning</small>
          </div>

          <div class="arch-node">
            <span>TRAINING</span>
            <small>Planning + Execution</small>
          </div>

          <div class="arch-node">
            <span>RUNTIME</span>
            <small>Serving + Operations</small>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="connector vertical"></div>

        <div class="arch-node bottom">
          <span>AXIOM PYTHON ENGINE</span>
          <small>CLI • Core • MCP • System</small>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="workflow" class="section workflow-section">
      <div class="section-heading reveal">
        <div>
          <span class="section-index">03 / WORKFLOW</span>
          <h2>From raw assets to controlled AI systems.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="workflow">
        <div class="workflow-step reveal">
          <span>01</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Discover</h3>
            <p>Bring your models and datasets into AXIOM.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="workflow-step reveal">
          <span>02</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Analyze</h3>
            <p>Understand model structure, data quality and hardware fit.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="workflow-step reveal">
          <span>03</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Prepare</h3>
            <p>Clean datasets and generate an appropriate training strategy.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="workflow-step reveal">
          <span>04</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Train</h3>
            <p>Run the engineering workflow using the platform's training layer.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="workflow-step reveal">
          <span>05</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Evaluate</h3>
            <p>Measure model quality before promoting a system.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="workflow-step reveal">
          <span>06</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Operate</h3>
            <p>Move into runtime, telemetry and controlled deployment.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-section">
      <div class="cta-grid"></div>

      <div class="cta-content reveal">
        <span class="section-index">NETCORE TECHNOLOGIES</span>
        <h2>Build without giving up control.</h2>
        <p>
          AXIOM is being built as an open engineering platform for
          people who want to understand and control their AI stack.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a
            class="button primary"
            href="https://github.com/NetCore-Technologies/AXIOM-AI"
            target="_blank"
          >
            Open GitHub
            <span>↗</span>
          </a>

          <a
            class="button secondary"
            href="https://github.com/NetCore-Technologies/AXIOM-AI/releases"
            target="_blank"
          >
            Download Release
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="footer-brand">
      <span class="brand-mark">A</span>
      <div>
        <strong>AXIOM</strong>
        <span>AI ENGINEERING PLATFORM</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p>Built by NetCore Technologies.</p>

    <a
      href="https://github.com/NetCore-Technologies/AXIOM-AI"
      target="_blank"
    >
      GitHub ↗
    </a>
  </footer>

  <script src="./script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
